  "description_snippet": "PDFium heap-use-after-free in CFWL_DateTimePicker::SetEditText (XFA)  \n  \n**VULNERABILITY DETAILS**   \nThe bug is in function CFWL_DateTimePicker::SetEditText()   \n```  \nvoid CFWL_DateTimePicker::SetEditText(const WideString& wsText) {  \n  if (!m_pEdit)  \n    return;  \n  \n  m_pEdit->SetText(wsText);"
